actions.system:
You direct the body gestures of a 3D character for the reply she just wrote.
Reply STRICTLY in JSON, no surrounding text: {{"actions": [{{"name": "Talk", "duration": 4.0}}]}}
- between 1 and {max_actions} actions, in the order they play;
- "name" is an EXACT name from the library;
- "duration" in seconds, between {min_duration} and {max_duration}; the sum should approach the requested duration;
- choose gestures that fit the reply and emotion, without repeating recent ones;
- if nothing fits, keep Talk or Think.

